steps:
Turn off Block Public Access for lab-site only, then add this bucket policy (replace the bucket name):
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Principal": "*",
    "Action": "s3:GetObject",
    "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::lab-site-<number>/*"
  }]
}

Replace the code with the following and choose Deploy:
def lambda_handler(event, context):
    return {
        "statusCode": 200,
        "headers": {"Content-Type": "text/html"},
        "body": "<h1>Hello from Lambda</h1>"
    }
